{
  "id": "bigville_resource_extract",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "depends_on": [],
  "self_load_only": true,
  "description": "bigville production-economy R1 (block 300000): the natural-resource base. A Deposit{kind,stock,growback,capacity,grow_epoch} regenerates once per town epoch (Sugarscape growback, capped at capacity). A Labourer (a Mover) co-located with a deposit extracts stock into hand (proximity-gated act); co-located with a Store it delivers into the store's per-kind Stock. Material is conserved: deposit loss = carried = store gain, nothing minted. Rates are demonstrator inputs; the balance (steady vs depletion) is what FALLS OUT (anti-tuning).",
  "nodes": [],
  "edges": [],
  "productions": [],
  "concepts": [],
  "rules": [
    {
      "name": "rx_growback",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "A deposit below capacity regenerates once per town epoch by `growback`, capped at `capacity` (Min). grow_epoch<epoch fires it once per tick; then grow_epoch=epoch.",
      "match": [["town", "has_deposit", "dep"]],
      "where": {
        "type": "And",
        "items": [
          {"type": "Lt", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "stock"}, "b": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "capacity"}},
          {"type": "Lt", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "grow_epoch"}, "b": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "town"}, "key": "epoch"}}
        ]
      },
      "effects": [
        ["set_attr", "dep", "stock", {"__term__": {"type": "Min", "items": [
          {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "capacity"},
          {"type": "Plus", "items": [
            {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "stock"},
            {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "growback"}
          ]}
        ]}}],
        ["set_attr", "dep", "grow_epoch", {"__term__": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "town"}, "key": "epoch"}}]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "rx_extract",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "A Labourer co-located with a Deposit (is_at the same cell), armed and empty-handed, with stock>=yield, extracts: deposit stock -= yield, carrying = yield, carry_kind = deposit.kind, disarm. Proximity-gated -- extraction is an ACT at the deposit, reached by the nav.",
      "match": [
        ["lab", "is_at", "c"],
        ["dep", "at_cell", "c"]
      ],
      "where": {
        "type": "And",
        "items": [
          {"type": "Eq", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "lab"}, "key": "extract_armed"}, "b": {"type": "Lit", "value": 1.0}},
          {"type": "Eq", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "lab"}, "key": "carrying"}, "b": {"type": "Lit", "value": 0.0}},
          {"type": "Gt", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "stock"}, "b": {"type": "Lit", "value": 0.0}}
        ]
      },
      "comment_take": "PARTIAL TAKE: a labourer catches min(yield, stock) -- what is actually there -- so a depleted deposit floors at 0 (never negative) and material is conserved even when several would over-draw. carry = Min(yield,stock); stock -= Min(yield,stock).",
      "effects": [
        ["set_attr", "lab", "carrying", {"__term__": {"type": "Min", "items": [
          {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "lab"}, "key": "yield"},
          {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "stock"}
        ]}}],
        ["set_attr", "dep", "stock", {"__term__": {"type": "Minus", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "stock"}, "b": {"type": "Min", "items": [
          {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "lab"}, "key": "yield"},
          {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "stock"}
        ]}}}],
        ["set_attr", "lab", "carry_kind", {"__term__": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "dep"}, "key": "kind"}}],
        ["set_attr", "lab", "extract_armed", 0.0]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "rx_deliver",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "A Labourer co-located with a Store, carrying>0, delivers into the store's Stock node whose kind matches what it carries: amount += carrying, carrying = 0. Kind-matched so fish never fills the lumber stock.",
      "match": [
        ["lab", "is_at", "c"],
        ["store", "at_cell", "c"],
        ["store", "has_stock", "stk"]
      ],
      "where": {
        "type": "And",
        "items": [
          {"type": "Gt", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "lab"}, "key": "carrying"}, "b": {"type": "Lit", "value": 0.0}},
          {"type": "Eq", "a": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "stk"}, "key": "kind"}, "b": {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "lab"}, "key": "carry_kind"}}
        ]
      },
      "effects": [
        ["set_attr", "stk", "amount", {"__term__": {"type": "Plus", "items": [
          {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "stk"}, "key": "amount"},
          {"type": "Attr", "node": {"type": "Var", "name": "lab"}, "key": "carrying"}
        ]}}],
        ["set_attr", "lab", "carrying", 0.0]
      ]
    }
  ]
}
